==================================================
BEFORE / AFTER COMPONENT
==================================================

This is a key feature.

Create a reusable BeforeAfterSlider component.

It should accept:

- beforeImage
- afterImage
- title
- description
- projectNumber

The component should display the after image as the main image with the before image clipped underneath/alongside it.

Add a draggable vertical divider.

The user should be able to:

- Drag the divider with mouse
- Drag with touch on mobile
- Use a pointer interaction
- See a circular handle at the center of the divider

Add labels:

BEFORE
AFTER

The slider should feel smooth and polished.

The divider should not look like a generic browser slider.

Create a custom visual handle.

For example:

     ← →

inside a small circular/rounded handle.

The comparison should work correctly on:

- Desktop
- Tablet
- Mobile

Make sure the images maintain the correct aspect ratio.

Do not distort the photographs.

