==================================================
IMPORTANT DESIGN RULES
==================================================

1. Photography is the hero of the website.

2. Do not use generic stock-style UI illustrations.

3. Do not fill every section with cards.

4. Use whitespace aggressively.

5. Use large typography strategically.

6. Keep the color palette restrained.

7. Let the photographs provide the color.

8. The before/after interaction should be one of the site's signature experiences.

9. Make the site feel like a creative professional's portfolio, not a developer template.

10. Avoid unnecessary gradients and glassmorphism.

11. Avoid excessive rounded cards.

12. Keep borders subtle.

13. Use smooth but restrained animation.

14. Make the design feel premium through spacing, typography, composition and imagery rather than excessive effects.

